@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
actor "Guest" as Guest
participant "LoginView\n(UI)" as UI
participant "UserService\n(Backend)" as Service
participant "UserRepository\n(DB)" as DB

Guest -> UI : Input Details & click "Login"
UI -> Service : authenticate(username, password)
activate Service

Service -> DB : findByEmailAndPassword(email, password)
activate DB
DB --> Service : return Optional<User>
deactivate DB

Note over Service: Verify password matches hash\nand fetch User Role

Service --> UI : return User object (or empty)
deactivate Service

Note over UI: If authenticated, set User into\nVaadinSession attributes

UI -> Guest : Update MainLayout & navigate to HomeView
@enduml